      "id": "claim_7eaa8146ae7043769045b11ef98c584e",
      "statement": "The shared `computeFuelSurcharge` returns 0 when the base price is unset, when the share percent is non-positive, when quota liters are non-positive, or when the current price does not exceed the base; otherwise the surcharge is `roundInt(round2dp(delta × quotaLiters × sharePct/100))`, and every trip creation snapshots the inputs (`currentFuelPrice`, `baseFuelPrice`, `quotaLiters`, `customerSharePct`) so future price changes do not retroactively rewrite cước đã phát hành.",
